Package: openappsec
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: aderumier <aderumier@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, python3, curl, ca-certificates
Recommends: nginx
Homepage: https://openappsec.io
Description: open-appsec WAF nano agent
 open-appsec is a machine-learning web application firewall that attaches to a
 supported reverse proxy (NGINX, Kong, APISIX) and inspects HTTP transactions
 out of process.
 .
 Upstream distributes the agent as self-extracting shell installers rather than
 distribution packages. This package carries those installers and drives them
 from its maintainer scripts, so the agent can be installed, upgraded and
 removed with apt like anything else on the host.
 .
 The NGINX attachment itself is NOT included: it is compiled against one exact
 NGINX build and must match the nginx package installed on the host. Install it
 with the upstream open-appsec-install script, and pin your nginx package so an
 upgrade cannot silently break the module.
